      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not exactly sure if I\u0027m a fan of allowing \"build all, but I want very specific toolchains\"\n\nWe should go with one of two approaches IMO ... either:\n\n1. Make an option for coverage on just one build, and people who need really specific toolchain setups can do it for both... or \n2. Make projects maintain a list of compatible toolchains, and a probe/search mechanism to find the first supported toolchain\n\n#2 sounds cleaner, #1 sounds easier",
      "range": {
